OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start, with rain in the
OL,6,Fwest soon moving eastwards to all
OL,7,Fareas. Occasionally heavy rain will
OL,8,Fease from early afternoon, although
OL,9,Fsome drizzle may continue near coasts.
OL,10,FWinds soon strengthening, especially
OL,11,Fon coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening, with
OL,14,Fsome drizzle. Cloud thickening in the
OL,15,Fearly hours, with further occasionally
OL,16,Fheavy rain arriving later in the
OL,17,Fnight. Winds becoming strong
OL,18,Fovernight, especially on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
