OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly heavy rain clearing
OL,6,Feastwards by late morning, then a
OL,7,Fbrighter day with sunny spells,
OL,8,Fperhaps with some isolated blustery
OL,9,Fshowers. Winds gradually easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells Wednesday, with isolated
OL,13,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Foggy
OL,14,FThursday morning, with sunny spells
OL,15,Flater. Likely mostly dry with sunny
OL,16,Fspells Friday. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
